  "evidence_summary": "CN complete native mesh aggregate B944E0[557] and constructor B94710[131], plus exact volatile B72B40[4] leaf and four compiler supports36B: 235 instruction owners,34 direct transfers, saved Ghidra/disk equal. Aggregate prefix publishes pair+4, then ordered nine-child dispatch: four nullable C-string comparisons followed by five counted425850 comparisons; LOD preserves two x87 float32 stores and captures mesh before reading. Every stateful child retains its own acquired frame; EH owns only current completed child. Constructor raw-slot unwind ends at native B94756 state-1 before added canonical admission; actual pair[0] and completed mesh survive metadata or parsing failure. Final empty loop captures current pair mesh before each local increment and rereads unsigned count; no per-section action or cached count. Two missing handlers created/saved under lock, seven prior comments preserved; no byte clear/no-return changes. Actual RTX5090 D3D9 fixture executes all nine fields, two full subsets with explicit/default stream paths and generic layout readback, normal count2 loop, mesh bind rejection after pair publication, and second outer sphere read failure after completed subset publication;31 canonical owners retire. Cached effect pass preimage remains explicit; no cold shader/compiler, original full-parent execution, native ABI/FH3/SEH or game claim.",
